OL,3,ADonald Trump Jr and Bettina Trump say
OL,4,APutin ally paid for some wedding
OL,5,Afestivities as a 'gift'
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump Jr's wife, Bettina Trump,
OL,8,Fconfirmed that their May wedding was
OL,9,Fpaid for in part by an ally of Russian
OL,10,FPresident Vladimir Putin.
OL,12,FA post on her Instagram account `
OL,13,Fattributed to the couple ` said that
OL,14,Ftwo nights of their three-day wedding
OL,15,Ffestivities on a private island in the
OL,16,FBahamas were partially funded by Umar
OL,17,FKremlev, a Russian oligarch with close
OL,18,Fties to Putin.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
