OL,3,ADonald Trump Jr and Bettina Trump say
OL,4,APutin ally paid for some wedding
OL,5,Afestivities as a 'gift'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe statement was released Monday after
OL,8,Finvestigative journalism outlet
OL,9,FProPublica published a story detailing
OL,10,Fthat Kremlev paid "hundreds of
OL,11,Fthousands of dollars" for the
OL,12,Fcelebration.
OL,14,FDonald Trump Jr, the president's eldest
OL,15,Fson, is a private citizen, so it is not
OL,16,Fillegal for him to accept gifts from a
OL,17,Fforeign national.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
